        "content": "## 🎨 AI 이미지 생성 프롬프트 (Flow / Midjourney 용)\n*디즈니/픽사 스타일의 3D 애니메이션 캐릭터 컨셉 아트용 영문 프롬프트입니다.*\n\n- **최민환 (Choi Min-hwan)**\n  > 3D CGI animated movie character, Pixar Disney style. A righteous, fierce former special prosecutor. Sharp, uncompromising eyes, slightly disheveled necktie, wearing a wet trench coat over a suit. He is standing in a dark, rain-slicked alleyway looking deeply resolute and angry. Cinematic lighting, highly detailed, intense dramatic atmosphere, 8k.\n- **강인태 (Kang In-tae)**\n  > 3D CGI animated movie character, Pixar Disney style. A cowardly and opportunistic Head of State. Wearing a perfectly tailored suit, but with an anxious, weak, yet cruel expression. He is standing in a luxurious, dimly lit secret room, nervously holding a gold pen about to sign a document. Cinematic lighting, deep shadows emphasizing his betrayal, 8k.\n- **칸 제국 주석 (Chairman of Khan Empire)**\n  > 3D CGI animated movie character, Pixar Disney style. The absolute ruler of a massive empire. Imposing, terrifying presence, cold snake-like eyes. He is holding a thick Cuban cigar. Wearing a dark, luxurious Mao-style overcoat. Sitting in a dark, opulent room with a roaring fireplace in the background illuminating his face. Cinematic lighting, highly detailed, intimidating atmosphere, 8k.\n- **비서실장 (Chief of Staff)**\n  > 3D CGI animated movie character, Pixar Disney style. A cold, meticulous, intellectual-looking man. Wearing gold-rimmed glasses and a sharp, elegant suit. He has a calculating, sinister smirk. He is holding a high-tech metallic biometric briefcase in a high-end hotel penthouse. Cinematic lighting, moody and elegant, highly detailed, 8k.\n\n\n---"
